WEBVTT

NOTE Silent video. Captions switch with the screen, not speech.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Add plugin marketplace — paste https://github.com/mitunmanav/anyone-can-code
Then click Add marketplace.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.000
Done — toast may say “anyone-can-code-marketplace is already added.”

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.600
Click Manage (gear) next to Installed plugins.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.600
Find Anyone Can Code in the list — keep it ON.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.700
Open the Anyone Can Code plugin page.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.800
Hooks settings — turn every ACC hook ON and trust them.
Required. Not automatic.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.200
Hooks overview: anyone-can-code shows 9 hooks.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:18.800
Skills stay enabled (all toggles on).

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.400
Plugin home — use Try now when ready.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.200
Chat with Anyone Can Code selected — say what you want in plain English.
